    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Unbreakable Golden Fortress is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile equipment fielded in Crazed Demon Cave, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Unbreakable Golden Fortress is the rank eight Immortal Gu House Fang Yuan created; it charges past Demon Immortal Qi Jue and resists waves of killer moves while Gu Immortals ride inside. It reaches the middle of the mountain, then crashes into Demon Judgment Board under Fang Zheng. The board’s blood-red beam hits the fortress; Unbreakable Golden Fortress raises its defense and blocks the light, but an unstoppable force still drives it down from mid-mountain. Even as a rank eight Immortal Gu House, it is far from Demon Judgment Board, a peak creation. Heavenly Court observers had expected Fang Yuan to rebuild Dragon Palace or Myriad Year Flying Warship; instead he fields seven new rank eight houses of this kind.",
      "chapters": [
        2179
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "book-mountain-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_demon_immortal_qi_jue",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "house_demon_judgment_board",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "house_dragon_palace",
        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Rising Cloud City is given to Demon Immortal Qi Jue and four of Fang Yuan’s houses leave the mountain, only Unbreakable Golden Fortress and Scarlet Palace remain on Book Mountain. When Demon Judgment Board races to stop Zhan Bu Du, Unbreakable Golden Fortress arrives as well and sends the board flying with a loud impact.",
      "chapters": [
        2181
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "remaining-houses",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhan_bu_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later counts that the seven Immortal Gu Houses he took out in Crazed Demon Cave, including Rising Cloud City, were all lost.",
